cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Iguanas: A Python library for generating, evaluating and selecting interpretable decision rules"
abstract: >-
  Iguanas is a Python library for building rule-based classifiers. It covers
  rule generation from gradient-boosted tree decision paths, rule evaluation
  and filtering, rule-set composition under user-specified constraints, and
  export to ONNX for deployment.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/paypal/Iguanas"
url: "https://paypal.github.io/Iguanas/"
